  "historyNote": "#13784, eff 10-21-23; ss by #14283, eff 8-1-25, (formerly Env-Hw 904.13); ss by #14527, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
